* MFS0-R1 transistor model family: EPFL-EKV v2.6 (Verilog-A, compiled ekv26.osdi)
* Parameter source (DEVICE): Alcatel-Mietec C05M 0.5um, EKV v2.6 parameter set,
*   M. Bucher, LEG-DE-EPFL, 98/03/25, "Extracted from on-wafer DC measurements"
*   (run 125/126, April 1997). File: chrisenz/EKV  EKV2.6/matlab/C05.lib
*   Typical case: VarN = VarP = 0 (LOT/GAUSS and DEV/GAUSS statistics not applied here).
* Validity range stated by the source: |Vg|<3.3V, |Vd|<3.3V, |Vs|<2V;
*   W = 0.8um..10um, L = 0.5um..10um.
* These are model parameters of a published extraction, not a re-measured process.
* Model type name ekv26_va = module name in ekv26.va (line 67).

.model nch ekv26_va (
+ TYPE=1
+ TNOM=25.5
+ COX=3.4m XJ=0.1u VTO=0.61 GAMMA=0.66 PHI=0.8 KP=169u
+ E0=99.0Meg UCRIT=4.3Meg DL=-0.07u DW=0.025u
+ LAMBDA=0.27 LETA=0.39 WETA=0.1 Q0=230u LK=0.66u
+ IBN=1.0 IBA=260Meg IBB=375Meg
+ TCV=1.7m BEX=-1.57 UCEX=1.6 IBBT=0.0
+ KF=1.6E-24 AF=1
+ HDIF=0.9u RSH=560
+ js=6.9u jsw=137p n=1.94
+ cj=740u cjsw=340p mj=0.35 mjsw=0.29 pb=0.73 pbsw=0.659
+ Cgso=138p Cgdo=138p Cgbo=345p )

.model pch ekv26_va (
+ TYPE=-1
+ TNOM=25.5
+ COX=3.4m XJ=0.1u VTO=-0.57 GAMMA=0.64 PHI=0.68 KP=39.6u
+ E0=56.4Meg UCRIT=20.0Meg DL=-0.05u DW=0.14u
+ LAMBDA=1.2 LETA=0.51 WETA=0.01 Q0=180u LK=0.67u
+ TCV=-1.36m BEX=-1.22 UCEX=2.0
+ IBA=0
+ KF=2.06E-25 AF=1
+ HDIF=0.9u RSH=1230
+ js=4.0u jsw=730p n=1.82
+ cj=790u cjsw=430p mj=0.4 mjsw=0.38 pb=0.85 pbsw=0.869
+ Cgso=138p Cgdo=138p Cgbo=345p )
